{"message":"Practice a **relaxed rise into your finish**. Since that free throw felt rushed and short, test the rhythm without changing your knee bend.

Shoot 5 comfortable shots from closer to the basket, letting the ball rise with you before you finish. Then shoot 5 from the free-throw line with the same cue: **“rise, then finish.”** Don’t add a pause or force the motion.

